<!--Post: 7836--><!--Time: 1108706043-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7836"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Johno<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Johno<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 17, 2005 - 9:54 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->1. Trophys, pleasure and proof. Remember he&#39;s a Zodiac-style killer-taunter. Zodiac was just into murder and sent in a piece of the cab driver&#39;s shirt who he killed as unmistakeable proof that this was him. BTK also has this in mind but he want to hang on to things from his hands on up close and personal sex thrill killings. <BR> <BR>2. Well he ain&#39;t walking off with a microwave or color TV, he justs wants something from the purse, jewelery box or nightstand. <BR> <BR>3. Most favored, any item from the purse that is conclusive proof of that victim or a piece of jewelery that can be identified as being the victim&#39;s. <BR> <BR>I think.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7836-->
<!--Post: 7965--><!--Time: 1108768362-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7965"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Brown_tornado<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Brown_tornado<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 18, 2005 - 3:12 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->In local news, Nancy Fox&#39;s co-worker &#40;Jewelry Store&#41; said that she&#39;s been asked about a missing watch of Nancy&#39;s. In several of the packages sent by BTK, there is supposed jewelry in them, also. WPD, FBI is in the process of verifying if they are from known victims of BTK. I also think he&#39;s taking simple personal items from the victims. I bet he has more jewelry than any of us know about. I bet he has panties from the murder victims, also. Maybe not all of the girls, but most. Maybe even multiple pairs from each. Maybe he found some in their dirty laundry with &#34;clitty litter&#34;. <BR>Why would someone go through a sexual fantasy with a person, leave semen, but not have intercourse with them? Obviously, DNA was not anywhere near then what it is today. Is rape an entirely different thing altogether for BTK? <BR>Wonder if he stroked himself when they were alive, or afterwards... <BR>I wonder if it was a turn-on for BTK to make his victims watch... <BR>I wonder if he uses any of his trophies for this reason &#40;spankin&#39; the &#39;ol monkey&#41; to remember the rush of the crime... <BR>I think he has far more things &#40;keepsakes&#41; than any of us know about.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7965-->
<!--Post: 8021--><!--Time: 1108810709-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8021"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:crazyhorse4440@hotmail.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Lola<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lola<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 19, 2005 - 2:58 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Ok brownie...that was just..just ...wrong! For pity sake! What if some of the victim&#39;s family would read what you wrote? Use some tact will ya? <BR>Posts like that will only encourage twisted minds, in my opinion. I can do without all that crap, we ALL know that BTK is a sicko without you getting all descriptive and stuff. IMO you just cheapened the whole point of this website.  <BR>Tom? Where are you??????????????<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8021-->
<!--Post: 8023--><!--Time: 1108820359-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8023"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lorenap<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lorenap<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 19, 2005 - 5:39 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Yep. Brown tornado I&#39;ve seen your postings in other areas of this website. None of them have put up a &#40;indecency&#41; red flag, until now. I suspect from your post you are a Kansan? I am too. I am ashamed to say I breathe the same air as you and I&#39;ll not only keep my eyes open for btk around here but you also. I think your 15 minutes are over. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
