<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8090"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Itty<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Itty<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 19, 2005 - 6:55 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->ditto<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8090-->
<!--Post: 8092--><!--Time: 1108870017-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8092"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Audreyamw<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Audreyamw<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 19, 2005 - 7:26 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK could be holding onto many trophies without giving much up to WPD.  Most women own more than one necklace.  If BTK spotted a victim&#39;s jewlery box and grabbed all or most of the contents, he could put several items in his pockets and leave with them.  He may only be sending LE a few token items while holding onto the rest.  Same thing with purse contents, he could empty a purse into the bag he brought with him. <BR> <BR>So is he really even sending all of his trophies to LE?  Or just enough to prove who he is &#40;and what he did&#41;?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8092-->
<!--Post: 8176--><!--Time: 1108955087-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8176"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Seesthru<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Seesthru<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->9-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, February 20, 2005 - 7:04 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Trophies.  The same reason an athlete keeps the trophies he wins are why a killer keeps his trophies.  Proof of accomplishment.   I&#39;m not saying athletes masturbate over trophies like killers do, but the  emotion is the same, great pride, a sense of power, accomplishment. <BR> <BR>My question is why is BTK now giving up his trophies?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8176-->
<!--Post: 8190--><!--Time: 1108964740-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8190"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Sherlock<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Sherlock<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, February 20, 2005 - 9:45 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->My theory, under Theories, is that BTK is dead and this is someone else farming out these trophies. Giving up a trophy establishes credibilty for an impostor. Anyone on this site could have written a letter claiming to be BTK. But when you have a victim&#39;s driver&#39;s license or a missing necklace to send in with your letter, well, you got the goods to be taken very seriously. <BR> <BR>Of course I could be wrong.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8190-->
<!--Post: 8192--><!--Time: 1108967338-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8192"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Freya<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Freya<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, February 20, 2005 - 10:28 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Brown, <BR>I wonder why you seem so confused about BTK&#39;s lack of ability or desire to have intercourse with his victims. Did you--by any chance--happen to notice the greater sexual deviancy of his need to KILL people in order to get off???!!!!!! Is masturbation really strange in comparison???  <BR> <BR>Also, your crude language is disrespectful to the memory of his victims, and indicates to me that you probably have some inappropriate ideas of your own. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8192-->
<!--Post: 8206--><!--Time: 1108990018-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8206"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Brady<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Brady<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, February 21, 2005 - 4:46 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Serial killers have been documenting their murders for years, keeping their own private mementos of their crimes to perpetuate the fantasy - it&#39;s part of their M.O. <BR> <BR>Brown Tornado, thank you for this thread.  However, the language in your second post is extremely crude.  Please use more discretion in the future.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8206-->
<!--Post: 8222--><!--Time: 1109007597-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8222"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Brown_tornado<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Brown_tornado<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, February 21, 2005 - 9:39 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->If you were offended by that post, I apologize. It was not intended to be offensive. It was meant only to encourage you to think about what he &#40;BTK&#41; has taken, but mostly, why. I think this could be insightful as to why he does what he does, that&#39;s it. <BR>Freya, no, masturbation is not strange...but the thought was...why doesn&#39;t he go all the way and leave his semen inside instead of around them? He obviously doesn&#39;t respect these victims and doesn&#39;t care how he hurts them or their loved ones. That was my point.  <BR>Also, the initial post was aimed at trying to get into the &#34;psychy&#34; of the killer. <BR>Sorry if I offended anyone, that was not my intention.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8222-->
<!--Post: 8239--><!--Time: 1109012092-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8239"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Steve_huff<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Steve_huff<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, February 21, 2005 - 10:54 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I&#39;d say BTK didn&#39;t commit rape with <i>penetration</i>, that we know of, because he is sexually immature - may have not even been with a woman consensually at the time the murders occurred. One of BTK&#39;s faves, Harvey Glatman, was a creeper and peeper for years before he killed anyone, and he never raped because he was, in a weird way, too scared of <i>that</i>. I know it stretches credulity to think that a person ballsy and weird enough to crawl in a stranger&#39;s window and masturbate to fulfill his fetish would not be ballsy enough to sexually attack a woman, but it&#39;s happened. The part above about Glatman was from his own well-documented confessions to LAPD. <BR> <BR>Additionally, my understanding is that fetishists almost don&#39;t need to actual contact, if the object of their fetish is available, readily - hence the keepsakes, mementoes.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8239-->
<!--Post: 8248--><!--Time: 1109014184-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8248"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Nessie2uk<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Nessie2uk<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, February 21, 2005 - 11:29 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Were all the women bound at the knees? <BR> <BR>This could be to prevent him getting a glimpse of the &#39;parts&#39; that scare him.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8248-->
<!--Post: 8257--><!--Time: 1109017983-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8257"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Brown_tornado<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Brown_tornado<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, February 21, 2005 - 12:33 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Steve, thank you for that insight. My ignorance to fetishes kept me from seeing it that way. Your thoughts could be entirely true, which would explain why he didn&#39;t &#34;penetrate&#34;, and, why he keeps whatever it is he keeps. <BR>BTW folks, don&#39;t think for a moment the WPD hasn&#39;t already talked about this within their investigation.  <BR>If we can understand WHY he &#40;BTK&#41; does what he does, then we should be MUCH closer to catching this S.O.B.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
