<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8400"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Tbear<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tbear<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, February 22, 2005 - 2:41 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->there was one other serial killer who was known to have sent at least 1 momento to the police. Jack the Ripper sent an organ &#40;liver, I believe&#41; to taunt the investigator.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
